<title>FINLAND: HUHTAMAKI JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 8.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUHTAMAKI JAN-APRIL PROFIT RISES 8.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   117 vs 108</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.10 vs 2.73</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,898 vs 2,521</p>
<p> Operating profit				   109 vs 156</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 13 analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy's profit after</p>
<p>financial items had been 125 million markka in a 90-160 million</p>
<p>markka range.</p>
<p> Net financial items			   gain 7 vs 43 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 160 charge</p>
<p>Gain/loss on equity of associated companies  1 vs 5 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						   34 vs 27</p>
<p> Net profit					    83 vs 79 loss</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI)(percent)	 11.1 vs 9.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Huhtamaki Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
